    <briefdescription>
<para>Compute TestVector Indices &quot;TVIdx&quot; from the Conds graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Clang CodeGen handles the bitmap index based on TVIdx. llvm-cov reconstructs conditions from TVIdx.</para>
<para>For each leaf &quot;The final decision&quot;,<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>TVIdx should be unique.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>TVIdx has the Width.<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The width represents the number of possible paths.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The minimum width is 1 &quot;deterministic&quot;.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The order of leaves are sorted by Width DESC. It expects latter TVIdx(s) (with Width=1) could be pruned and altered to other simple branch conditions. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
